{"4635160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dawn's Edge", "steam_appid": 4635160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635160/extras/55a8e5624c4dd6f0b8ca8489928a46a6.avif?t=1787817731\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635160/extras_big/55a8e5624c4dd6f0b8ca8489928a46a6.avif?t=1787817731 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Sword River Realm — where every soul in the world flows to rest.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But souls steeped in evil have begun to seep in as well, corrupting the realm from within — and the blight is spreading</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > into the mortal world itself. The fallen heroes of the jianghu return to your side as spirits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stand with them, and set right a fate that has been led astray.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ A jianghu the size of 40+ novels the deeper you read, the deeper you fall</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635160/extras/ee60c146e7a6fd6592f50ab446a1a999.avif?t=1787817731\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635160/extras_big/ee60c146e7a6fd6592f50ab446a1a999.avif?t=1787817731 width=1560 height=668 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sprawling scenario of over 4 million written characters — the equivalent of more than 40 published volumes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every nameless villager, every wandering swordsman who crosses your path carries a story and a motive of their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Uncover the hidden side of the world through side quests tucked into every corner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the main story alone, and you'll come away feeling as though you've read an epic saga cover to cover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Explore a vast world — a jianghu you complete with your own two feet</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635160/extras/bdfac99f13ce38c62a68b76cf8a04927.avif?t=1787817731\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635160/extras_big/bdfac99f13ce38c62a68b76cf8a04927.avif?t=1787817731 width=1560 height=668 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast jianghu that feels like wandering through a classical ink-wash painting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From snow-capped peaks to mist-veiled bamboo groves, every step turns a new landscape into a new story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a game that walks you down a fixed path — roam the jianghu at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Strategy that borders on limitless</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635160/extras/d0d4b28d97cd75c3eb707601c3ee1f59.avif?t=1787817731\" width=1200 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit the jianghu's most distinctive heroes and build your own lineup by combining inner arts and tactics cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Battles weave each hero's signature skills, your collected inner arts and tactics cards, and battlefield formations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > together in real time — victory turns on which heroes you field, which tactics you unleash, and when. Perfect a martial</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > style all your own amid fast, fluid action, topple bosses each armed with their own techniques, and climb to ever greater heights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Growth that never stops</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635160/extras/4fb7c16581cd9bd44273a865d8bcbbca.avif?t=1787817731\" width=1200 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True wuxia progression, built on ever-deepening inner strength. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power is etched into the heroes themselves. Collect and refine inner arts to forge a combat style that is yours alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > From martial training to gear enhancement, every step you take today becomes the foothold for a higher plane</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > tomorrow — a journey without end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Experience a proven wuxia-fantasy universe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635160/extras/b0fd2ba6c4486bab594c0a6c4d57f1cf.avif?t=1787817731\" width=1444 height=568 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Han-Squirrel Studio — creators of <i>Hanjia Jianghu</i> (汉家江湖), with 7 million downloads worldwide, and <i>Sands of</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> Salzaar</i>, with over 2 million downloads on Steam alone. The studio behind these acclaimed wuxia-fantasy worlds now</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > brings their characters together on a single stage for an all-new story set in the Sword River Realm. A multiverse wuxia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > fantasy begins — one that will draw in longtime fans and newcomers alike.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635160/extras/55a8e5624c4dd6f0b8ca8489928a46a6.avif?t=1787817731\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635160/extras_big/55a8e5624c4dd6f0b8ca8489928a46a6.avif?t=1787817731 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Sword River Realm — where every soul in the world flows to rest.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But souls steeped in evil have begun to seep in as well, corrupting the realm from within — and the blight is spreading</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > into the mortal world itself. The fallen heroes of the jianghu return to your side as spirits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stand with them, and set right a fate that has been led astray.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ A jianghu the size of 40+ novels the deeper you read, the deeper you fall</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635160/extras/ee60c146e7a6fd6592f50ab446a1a999.avif?t=1787817731\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635160/extras_big/ee60c146e7a6fd6592f50ab446a1a999.avif?t=1787817731 width=1560 height=668 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sprawling scenario of over 4 million written characters — the equivalent of more than 40 published volumes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every nameless villager, every wandering swordsman who crosses your path carries a story and a motive of their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Uncover the hidden side of the world through side quests tucked into every corner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the main story alone, and you'll come away feeling as though you've read an epic saga cover to cover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Explore a vast world — a jianghu you complete with your own two feet</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635160/extras/bdfac99f13ce38c62a68b76cf8a04927.avif?t=1787817731\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635160/extras_big/bdfac99f13ce38c62a68b76cf8a04927.avif?t=1787817731 width=1560 height=668 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast jianghu that feels like wandering through a classical ink-wash painting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From snow-capped peaks to mist-veiled bamboo groves, every step turns a new landscape into a new story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a game that walks you down a fixed path — roam the jianghu at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Strategy that borders on limitless</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635160/extras/d0d4b28d97cd75c3eb707601c3ee1f59.avif?t=1787817731\" width=1200 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit the jianghu's most distinctive heroes and build your own lineup by combining inner arts and tactics cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Battles weave each hero's signature skills, your collected inner arts and tactics cards, and battlefield formations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > together in real time — victory turns on which heroes you field, which tactics you unleash, and when. Perfect a martial</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > style all your own amid fast, fluid action, topple bosses each armed with their own techniques, and climb to ever greater heights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Growth that never stops</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635160/extras/4fb7c16581cd9bd44273a865d8bcbbca.avif?t=1787817731\" width=1200 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True wuxia progression, built on ever-deepening inner strength. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power is etched into the heroes themselves. Collect and refine inner arts to forge a combat style that is yours alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > From martial training to gear enhancement, every step you take today becomes the foothold for a higher plane</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > tomorrow — a journey without end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Experience a proven wuxia-fantasy universe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635160/extras/b0fd2ba6c4486bab594c0a6c4d57f1cf.avif?t=1787817731\" width=1444 height=568 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Han-Squirrel Studio — creators of <i>Hanjia Jianghu</i> (汉家江湖), with 7 million downloads worldwide, and <i>Sands of</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> Salzaar</i>, with over 2 million downloads on Steam alone. The studio behind these acclaimed wuxia-fantasy worlds now</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > brings their characters together on a single stage for an all-new story set in the Sword River Realm. A multiverse wuxia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > fantasy begins — one that will draw in longtime fans and newcomers alike.</p>", "short_description": "Awaken as a memory-stripped supreme master in a twisted jianghu. Shatter the world's cursed formations, master strategic wuxia combat where one right technique turns the tide, and reclaim your lost throne — while idle progress and a living martial world carry on even when your sword rests.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635160/c942f9f41fa0b2d10ade10964d19eed6de5b155a/header.jpg?t=1787817731", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635160/6e34f9fb10e3a4b214bc0240d94818dbe